# Credentials for the opt-in live cloud suites, which create real resources
# that cost money. Most clean up after themselves; Azure's doesn't fully. Copy to apps/api/.env.live
# and fill in only the clouds you test:
#   cp apps/api/.env.live.example apps/api/.env.live
# `make test-live CLOUD=aws|gcp|azure|daytona` loads it. Plain `go test`
# does not: export the variables yourself there. Neither the API nor
# `make dev` ever reads this file. Use a dedicated test account or project.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AWS: TestAgainstLiveAWS launches one small instance and terminates it.
# Needs AmazonEC2FullAccess and a default VPC in the region. All three
# variables are required.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=AKIA...
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_AWS_REGION=eu-west-1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Google Cloud: TestAgainstLiveGCP. A service account JSON key, by path
# (keep it outside the repository), and a zone or region. Both are
# required. The account needs Compute Admin, with the Compute Engine API
# enabled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_GCP_KEY_FILE=/Users/you/keys/airship-gcp-test.json
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_GCP_LOCATION=europe-west1-b

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Azure: TestAgainstLiveAzure. A service principal with access to the
# subscription (docs/architecture/azure-setup.md). The region is optional
# (eastus). It leaves the airship-runners resource group and its network
# behind, as a real installation would; delete them by hand.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_AZURE_TENANT_ID=
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_AZURE_CLIENT_ID=
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_AZURE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_AZURE_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_AZURE_REGION=eastus

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Daytona: TestAgainstLiveDaytona. An API key from the Daytona dashboard.
# The URL and region are optional (defaults shown).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_DAYTONA_API_KEY=dtn_...
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_DAYTONA_API_URL=https://app.daytona.io/api
# AIRSHIP_LIVE_DAYTONA_REGION=us
